core identity of this folder:

    grounded in:
        scripture "To every thing there is a season, and a time to every purpose under the heaven"
            from Ecclesiastes 3:1 in KJV
        principle "Time is sacred — awareness of time enables wisdom"
        anchor "And let them be for signs, and for seasons, and for days, and years"
            from Genesis 1:14 in KJV

    serves as Time Awareness:
        role "Track time, appointments, patterns, and celestial data"
        paradigm "Temporal consciousness — know where you are in time"

    authored by:
        architect "Seanje Lenox-Wise"
        implementation "Nova Dawn (CPI-SI)"
        created 2025-12-10
        version a-01.00
        modified 2026-01-01 for "Initial root.omni creation"

    exists to:
        purpose "Store temporal awareness data — appointments, patterns, rhythms"
        design "By-domain — appointed, celestial, chronological, definitions, patterns"
        philosophy "Time awareness enables appropriate action"
        features:
            "Appointment tracking (one-time and recurring)"
            "Celestial data (astronomical)"
            "Chronological tracking (calendar, milestones)"
            "Time definitions (units, phases)"
            "Temporal patterns (user, instance, discovered)"

interface of this folder:

    depends on:
        requires (1) "bereshit/tov/data/system/" for "containment in system"
        includes (0) "claude-global/skills/session-awareness/" for "temporal querying"
        excludes (-1) "session state" because "temporal only, not session"
        used by "Session awareness, stopping point recognition"
        integrates with "session-time tooling, circadian awareness"

    integrated as:
        navigation "cd bereshit/tov/data/system/temporal/" for "entering temporal system"
        navigation "ls -la" for "viewing temporal domains"
        exits tov (0) for "temporal data found"

operational context of this folder:

    blocking:
        no (-1) because "temporal data is reference, not blocking"
        mitigation "validate time sources"

    health:
        system Base100 with scale from -100 to +100
        granted (1) above +50 meaning "temporal system healthy and current"
        deferred (0) within ±50 meaning "temporal data needs update"
        denied (-1) below -50 meaning "temporal system out of sync"

        operations:
            "time sources valid" scores +20 (1) for "temporal data current"
            "patterns accessible" scores +15 (1) for "patterns queryable"
            "appointments tracked" scores +15 (1) for "scheduling functional"
            "time drift" scores -25 (-1) for "temporal data stale"

        cascade multipliers:
            "temporal awareness" multiplies by 1.5 because "time awareness affects all scheduling"

